{
  "codename": "终端脉动",
  "slug": "terminal-pulse",
  "summary": "把桌宠做成一个可爱的 CLI 进程：状态胶囊就是 statusline，动作就是进度条与行内提示，会话跟随是一个常驻的 agent 标签页。近黑冷调底 + 中性灰阶 + 一个克制的荧光主色，等宽只用于标签与元信息，正文交给 YaHei。",
  "colors": {
    "bg": "#070A09",
    "surface": "#0C1210",
    "surfaceAlt": "#111917",
    "line": "#1E2B26",
    "lineStrong": "#31443C",
    "text": "#D8E2DB",
    "textMuted": "#8DA096",
    "textFaint": "#6E8278",
    "accent": "#54F0A6",
    "accentSoft": "#0E2A1D",
    "accentText": "#05130C",
    "secondary": "#A38BFF",
    "state": {
      "idle": "#8DA096",
      "thinking": "#79B8FF",
      "working": "#54F0A6",
      "input": "#E8D44D",
      "approval": "#E8A33B",
      "done": "#4FD8E8",
      "error": "#FF5F66",
      "sleep": "#5F7379"
    },
    "lightVariant": {
      "bg": "#F3F7F2",
      "surface": "#FFFFFF",
      "surfaceAlt": "#F7FAF7",
      "line": "#D6E2D6",
      "lineStrong": "#B9CBBE",
      "text": "#15211B",
      "textMuted": "#5C6E62",
      "textFaint": "#7A8C80",
      "accent": "#0E9B63",
      "accentSoft": "#E3F3E9",
      "accentText": "#04130B"
    }
  },
  "fonts": {
    "display": "'Microsoft YaHei', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif",
    "ui": "'Microsoft YaHei', 'Noto Sans SC', sans-serif",
    "mono": "Consolas, 'Cascadia Mono', 'Segoe UI Symbol', 'Microsoft YaHei', monospace"
  },
  "type": {
    "display": { "size": 40, "weight": 700, "lineHeight": 1.05, "family": "ui" },
    "h1": { "size": 26, "weight": 700, "lineHeight": 1.15, "family": "ui" },
    "h2": { "size": 17, "weight": 600, "lineHeight": 1.2, "family": "ui" },
    "body": { "size": 13, "weight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.55, "family": "ui" },
    "meta": { "size": 11, "weight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.4, "family": "ui" },
    "mono": { "size": 10, "weight": 400, "lineHeight": 1.4, "family": "mono" },
    "micro": { "size": 8.5, "weight": 500, "lineHeight": 1.2, "family": "mono" }
  },
  "radius": {
    "window": 2,
    "panel": 2,
    "card": 2,
    "control": 2,
    "pill": 2,
    "note": 0
  },
  "border": {
    "width": 1,
    "soft": "#1E2B26",
    "strong": "#31443C",
    "innerHighlight": "rgba(255, 255, 255, 0.04)"
  },
  "shadow": {
    "panel": "0 16px 48px rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.55)",
    "control": "0 1px 0 rgba(0, 0, 0, 0.40)",
    "glow": "0 0 18px rgba(84, 240, 166, 0.45)"
  },
  "motion": {
    "easing": "cubic-bezier(.2, .8, .2, 1)",
    "fast": "90ms",
    "base": "160ms",
    "slow": "320ms",
    "breathe": "3.2s",
    "framed": "steps(8, end)",
    "note": "扫描线 8s linear infinite；光标 1s steps(2) 闪烁；所有动效在 prefers-reduced-motion: reduce 下把 duration 压到 0ms，仅保留颜色/可见性切换；进度条用 steps(8) 而非线性插值，保留「跳格」的终端手感。"
  },
  "notes": "圆角只有 0 与 2：状态块、进度段、任务栏、键帽底为 0，面板/卡片/控件为 2；pill 也取 2，靠左右内边距而不是半圆来做出胶囊感。描边一律 1px，暗色下靠 line/lineStrong 两级灰而不是阴影分层；荧光主色只用于前景文字、1px 描边、实心主按钮与 ≤8% 面积的进度段，其余层级全部由中性灰阶承担。等宽字体只承担状态标签、路径、数字与快捷键，中文正文一律 YaHei，避免等宽中文字距过宽。浅色变体不是简单反色：accent 压深到 #0E9B63、line 提亮，保持 ≥4.5:1 对比。"
}
